    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16517" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀστερ-ωπός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>star-faced, star-like,
				bright-shining,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄμμα Λητῴας κόρης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					170
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νυκτὸς ἀ. σέλας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hipp.</u>
					851
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ph.</u>
				129
			</span></i> (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>star-eyed, starry,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰθήρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ion</u>
					1078
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. οὐρανοῦ δέμας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Critias
					25.33D.
				</span></i>
			</div>
